## Append to an issue with no description

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=.pebbles pebbles update 22222222 --append-description "Starts fresh"
✓ Updated issue
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
